  "rai:dataLimitations": "The benchmark is a physics-grounded DOE/surrogate-method benchmark, not a collection of externally validated engineering design workflows. P2 cases remain plausibility-only or analytical-control stress tests unless upgraded by case-specific validation notes. Full-scale headline results are pending until the Linux server sweep and return-package gates pass.",
  "rai:dataBiases": "The suite intentionally over-represents low-cost algebraic, analytical, and surrogate physics cases to make large paired method comparisons affordable. It is not a representative sample of all industrial simulation workloads, high-fidelity CFD/FEA/MDAO workflows, or site-specific engineering validation datasets.",
  "rai:personalSensitiveInformation": "No human-subject, demographic, health, political, religious, socioeconomic, or personally sensitive data are included. The archive consists of synthetic/physics-generated engineering benchmark rows and derived analysis artifacts.",
  "rai:dataUseCases": "Intended use: reproducible comparison of DOE, surrogate modelling, Bayesian optimization, active learning, and reliability-oriented sampling methods under the frozen preregistered protocol. Not recommended for certifying engineering designs, validating individual physics solvers, or training models for deployment decisions without independent domain validation.",
  "rai:dataSocialImpact": "Positive impact: transparent, reproducible, physics-grounded benchmarking may reduce misleading method claims and improve experimental practice. Risks: users may over-interpret plausibility-only cases as validated engineering simulators; evidence-tier labels, web-validation audits, and manuscript limitations mitigate this risk.",
  "rai:hasSyntheticData": true,
  "url": "Not yet public. Supply the public archive URL and DOI here before submission (see docs/SUBMISSION_EXTERNAL_INPUT_TEMPLATE_20260901.md); no link is asserted until the deposit is minted."
